#
#
# ~chewygumxx/dotfiles.git
# ::: :/.agents/skills/.gitignore
#
#

#
# Everything here that `bun install` (the prepare script) puts back. Tracking
# it only invites drift: the header sync rewrites the path boxes of copies,
# which then no longer match skills-lock.json's computedHash. .claude/skills
# is a link to this directory, so this file covers both agents.
#
# Skills hand-written in this directory, and in neither list, stay tracked.
#

# Restored from skills-lock.json by `skills experimental_install`. One line
# per skill in the lock; add one whenever `skills add` adds to it.
/managing-dotfiles-with-chezmoi/

# Links to this repo's own skills in skills/<name>/, made by `bun run
# skills:link`. A link is a file to git, so no trailing slash. One line per
# directory in skills/.
/managing-session-environment
